{"id":"00168","root":"uni00168_1","name":{"ja":"葉隠　真千子","en":"Hagakure Machiko"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"葉隠　真千子","en":"Hagakure Machiko"},"element":"Natural","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-02-28","limited":false,"characterId":136,"profile":{"ja":"対魔忍。ふうま八将の一角、葉隠家当主。アサギとふうま一門の戦いにおいて父が敗死すると若くして当主となる。アサギとは和睦し、その後は五車に属さず闇の町の一角を支配し独立していたが、二車骸佐が反乱すると彼に協力する事に。ただし彼女は父の復讐だとか、ふうま一門の再興だという“政治的”な目的には一切興味が無く、葉隠家の利益と彼女自身の戦いを嗜む本能に従っている。剛剣使いとして名高い。彼女の忍法“葉遁の術”は葉っぱを舞い散らせその姿を隠すというもの。彼女が常に“黒い葉”で出来たコートを対魔スーツの上に纏っていて、彼女が忍法を為す時はコートから黒い葉が舞い散り、一瞬でその姿を隠し、次に姿を表す時には敵を一刀両断した時であるという。","en":"Hagakure Machiko is a Taimanin and one of the eight Fuuma generals, the head of the Hagakure clan. After her father fell in battle against Asagi and the Fuuma school, she assumed leadership at a young age. She later reconciled with Asagi and, instead of joining Gosha, she ruled a corner of the dark city independently. When Nisha Gaiza rebelled, she chose to aid him. However, she has no interest in \"political\" motives such as avenging her father or reviving the Fuuma school; she follows her instincts to protect the Hagakure clan's interests and enjoy the fight. She is famed for her mastery of the heavy sword. Her ninjutsu \"Leaf Technique\" scatters leaves to conceal her form. She constantly wears a coat of black leaves over her Taimanin suit; when she activates her ninjutsu, black leaves burst from the coat, instantly hiding her, and she reappears only after she has cleaved her enemy in two."},"illustrator":"おぶい","voiceActor":"藍河しおん","forms":[{"id":"uni00168_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[958,1916],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[140,280],"def":[116,232],"spd":[81,81],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","102007"]},{"id":"uni00168_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1416,2832],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[215,430],"def":[167,334],"spd":[81,81],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","102007","102008"]}